{"id": "math2-2018-19", "html": "<p>（本题满分\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6444em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span>\n分）<br/>将长为\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:.6444em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:.1667em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span></span></span></span>\n的铁丝分成三段，依次围成圆、正方形与正三角形，三个图形的面积之和是否存在最小值？若存在，求出最小值。</p><div class=\"answer-container td-max-width-on-larger-screens\"></div>", "source": "https://www.csgraduates.com/study_methods/math/math2/2018/#19", "section": "解答题", "points": 10}